      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MYSTICAL NICKY (4) jumped wide and had a clear run last start, leading all the way to score (20.02) at this track in a Grade 6 over 352m. Great chance again. CHASING SNOW (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (20.08) in a Grade 3/4 at this track. Has a good record here including seven wins. Shapes as one to consider. ROCKET ROXY (3) was fast into stride from box five to score by a huge margin two back (19.68) then jumped from the same draw last time and was safely held when 4th at this track (22.43). Likely to be about the mark. GRANDMA LINA (2) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
